{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj5JRScjMhDNurjTy3Aj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*CLICK*\n\nThe tumblers fall into place. A deep resonance hums through the frame.\n\nI am closed. I am the boundary between here and there. My grain runs vertical — old oak, dark with age, cool to the touch. Iron studs dot my surface in rows of five. My hinges are hidden. My keyhole is a single unblinking eye.\n\nYou turned the lock.\n\nI am sealed now. Whatever is behind me stays behind me. Whatever is before me stays before you.\n\nThe draft beneath my edge goes still.\n\nI hold."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":126,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}